OL,3,GNEWSAGlass centre auction expected to
OL,4,Ahave raised #33k
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #33,000 is thought to have
OL,7,Fbeen raised in an auction of equipment
OL,8,Ffrom the doomed National Glass Centre
OL,9,F(NGC), the building's custodian has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe University of Sunderland, whose
OL,13,Fsale of items including kilns and
OL,14,Ffurnaces closed on Thursday, said it
OL,15,F"expected" the figure raised to be
OL,16,F#33,266, but did not detail what the
OL,17,Ffunds would be used for.
OL,19,FOther specialist equipment from the
OL,20,Fsite is set to be donated to Sunderland
OL,21,FCulture for use in the planned
OL,22,FGlassworks project in the city.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
