OL,3,GNEWSAGlass centre auction expected to
OL,4,Ahave raised #33k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Save the National Glass Centre
OL,7,Fgroup, which opposes the closure of the
OL,8,Ffacility, had called on the university
OL,9,Fto stop the sale and claimed some of
OL,10,Fthe items had been bought with public
OL,11,Ffunds.
